      "inputs": "Seven legal M even/Ktile/group aligned cases, 8/4/3 learned \u00b11 bitplanes with all32 packed positions active, bias/no-bias and zero-input control. Exact F16quarter inputs, learned signedF16scales/bias1/128, dense packedUInt32 weights. Actual allinput bitpayload+guards echoed.",
